e license from Meta\", \"attribution \'Built with Llama\'\"]','{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"scope_note\": \"governs the base model meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct whose weights this model was fine-tuned from\", \"license_key\": \"llama3.1-community\", \"license_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct/blob/main/LICENSE\", \"commercial_use\": \"restricted\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct/blob/main/USE_POLICY.md\"}'),(284,'model:HiTZ/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-multi-truth-judge','Apache License 2.0',NULL,NULL,'{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"declared license for this model\'s fine-tuned weights, fine-tuning code, and the HiTZ/truthful_judge training dataset (per model card); the HF repo tag itself is \'license:llama3.1\'\", \"license_key\": \"apache-2.0\", \"license_uri\": \"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\"}'),(285,'model:HPAI-BSC/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-Egida-DPO','Apache License 2.0',NULL,NULL,'{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"Declared directly on the HPAI-BSC/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-Egida-DPO model card (license: apache-2.0); consistent with the Apache-2.0 license of the base Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct model and the HPAI-BSC/Egida dataset.\", \"license_key\": \"apache-2.0\", \"license_uri\": \"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\"}'),(286,'model:mellee030/MedQwen-7B-LoRA','Apache License 2.0',NULL,NULL,'{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"Declared in the HF card YAML front-matter (license: apache-2.0) for the adapter itself; the base model Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct is also released under Apache-2.0.\", \"license_key\": \"apache-2.0\", \"license_uri\": \"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\"}'),(287,'model:meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct','Llama 3.1 Community Licens