herited)\", \"multilingual dialogue in 8 languages (inherited)\", \"long-context (128K) inference (inherited)\", \"tool use / function calling (inherited)\"]','[\"inherits all base-model limitations and biases (no new training)\", \"no independent safety evaluation of the converted artifact\", \"requires mlx-lm / Apple silicon runtime to load\"]',415,'{\"evidence\": [24, 74, 102, 103, 104, 105, 108, 109], \"unknowns\": [\"Exact mlx-lm conversion command and flags used\", \"Numerical-equivalence testing between the original and MLX weights\", \"Whether any of the source model\'s gated-access metadata (e.g. exact license acceptance text shown to convertor) differs from the standard Llama 3.1 Community License\", \"Precise training/pretraining dataset inventory (inherited from source, not re-disclosed in the MLX card)\"], \"release_date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2023-12\"}'),('mlx-community/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-bf16','{\"family\": \"decoder-only Transformer (dense, Qwen2 architecture, unchanged by conversion)\", \"layers\": 28, \"ffn_size\": 18944, \"kv_heads\": 4, \"attention\": \"grouped-query attention with QKV bias\", \"activation\": \"SwiGLU (silu)\", \"rope_theta\": 1000000, \"hidden_size\": 3584, \"torch_dtype\": \"bfloat16\", \"normalization\": \"RMSNorm\", \"context_length\": 32768, \"sliding_window\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 28, \"parameter_count\": 7615616512, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE\", \"use_sliding_window\": false}','{\"name\": \"Qwen2 byte-level BPE (Qwen2Tokenizer)\", \"vocab_size\": 152064}','{\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"], \"languages\": [\"en\"]}','MLX-format repackaging of Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (BF16 weights) for local inference on Apple silicon via mlx-lm; same general-assistant / instruction-following use case as the source model.','[\"instruction following (inherited)\", \"long-form generation and structured/JSON output (inherited)\", \"multilingual interaction across 29+ languages per source model (inherited)\"]','[\"inherits all base-model limitations and biases (no new training)\", \"no independent safety evaluation of the converted artifact\", \"shipped config.json caps native context at 32,768 tokens; the source model\'s full 131,072-token context requires enabling YaRN RoPE scaling, which is not set in this repo\'s config.json\", \"requires mlx-lm / Apple silicon runtime to load\"]',416,'{\"evidence\": [30, 81, 86, 110, 111, 112, 113, 117, 118], \"unknowns\": [\"Exact mlx-lm conversion command and flags used\", \"Numerical-equivalence testing between the original and MLX weights\", \"Explicit knowledge cutoff date for Qwen2.5 pretraining data (not disclosed in the model card)\", \"Precise pretraining dataset inventory (inherited from source, not re-disclosed in the MLX card)\", \"Whether YaRN rope scaling is intended to be user-enabled for this MLX repo the way it is documented for the source Transformers repo\"], \"release_date\": \"2024-09-18\"}'),('openai/gpt-oss-120b','{\"family\": \"autoregressive mixture-of-experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 36, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 116829156672, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE with YaRN scaling\"}','{\"name\": \"o200k_harmony BPE\", \"vocab_size\": 201088}','{\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"]}','A general-purpose, high-reasoning open-weight model for developer use, including agentic workflows, tool use, and adjustable reasoning effort. The model card describes support for browser and Python tools, function calling, and structured outputs.','[\"Reasoning with low, medium, or high effort settings\", \"Web browsing and Python tool use\", \"Function calling\", \"Structured outputs\", \"Full chain-of-thought access\"]','[\"Knowledge cutoff is June 2024.\", \"Use the Harmony conversation format; the model card warns that it may not work correctly otherwise.\", \"The model can hallucinate, and its chain-of-thought can contain hallucinated content.\", \"The model is not intended for diagnosis or treatment of disease and does not replace a medical professional.\", \"The report finds weaker instruction-hierarchy performance than OpenAI o4-mini on its reported evaluations.\"]',433,'{\"source\": \"ai_research\", \"artifact\": {\"tensor_type\": \"MXFP4\"}, \"evidence\": [1065, 1066, 1067, 1068, 1069, 1070, 1071, 1072, 1073, 1074, 1075, 1076, 1077, 1078, 1079], \"unknowns\": [\"The model card does not identify the exact pretraining documents or disclose a detailed pretraining mixture.\", \"The model card does not disclose the exact post-training dataset composition, example counts, or dataset versions.\", \"The reviewed sources do not identify a separate public GPT-OSS base checkpoint or a direct external weight parent.\", \"The exact few-shot counts and per-evaluation prompting details are not stated for every reported benchmark.\", \"The repository includes multiple weight representations; the precise tensor-type breakdown of every artifact file is not recorded in this draft.\", \"The exact identity and parameter checkpoint of the model used as the base for pretraining or distillation are not disclosed.\", \"The report does not name the distillation teacher checkpoint(s) or fully detail the distillation procedure.\", \"Exact pretraining corpus composition, dataset versions, and dataset licenses are not disclosed.\", \"Exact post-training dataset composition, sizes, and dataset licenses are not disclosed.\", \"Most training hyperparameters and the exact training completion date are not disclosed.\", \"Evaluation dataset revisions and few-shot counts are not specified in the reported tables.\", \"The paper reports total parameters as 116.83B; a more precise unrounded parameter integer is not provided in the report.\"], \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2024-06\"}');
