ctly to end users\", \"Can hallucinate; it underperformed OpenAI o4-mini on SimpleQA and PersonQA\", \"Instruction-hierarchy robustness is weaker than OpenAI o4-mini in reported evaluations\", \"Not intended for diagnosis or treatment of disease\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 24, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 20914757184, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE (YaRN)\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"Configurable low, medium, and high reasoning effort\", \"Chain-of-thought reasoning\", \"Function calling and structured outputs\", \"Web browsing and Python code-execution tool use\", \"Fine-tuning for specialized use cases\"], \"intended_use\": \"An open-weight reasoning and agentic text-generation model intended for lower-latency local or specialized developer use cases. It is designed for harmony-formatted chat, configurable reasoning effort, function calling, browsing, Python tool use, and structured outputs.\"}, \"dataset\": [{\"license\": null, \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-mixture\", \"extensions\": {\"name\": \"gpt-oss pretraining mixture\", \"size\": \"Trillions of tokens\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"description\": \"A text-only corpus of trillions of tokens focused on STEM, coding, and general knowledge.\"}, \"processing\": [\"Filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN pre-training filters reused from GPT-4o.\"], \"provenance\": {\"origin\": null, \"parent\": [], \"evidence\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"relation\": \"original\", \"extensions\": {\"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}}}, {\"license\": null, \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-post-training-mixture\", \"extensions\": {\"name\": \"gpt-oss post-tr