CoT RL로 post-training되었다고만 설명하므로 parentCandidates는 비워 두었습니다.\", \"INSTRUCT 분류는 공개 저장소가 OpenAI의 주된 harmony-formatted chat/instruction 배포물이라는 문서에 근거합니다. 다만 별도 공개 BASE가 없어 정의상의 직접 짝 BASE는 검증할 수 없습니다.\", \"모델 카드의 파라미터 표기는 20.91B이고 Hugging Face safetensors 메타데이터 총계는 정확히 20,914,757,184입니다. AIBOM에는 후자를 사용했습니다.\", \"훈련 데이터는 고수준 설명만 공개되었습니다. 개별 코퍼스·post-training 데이터셋의 명칭, 라이선스, 비율은 추정하지 않았습니다.\", \"OpenRouter 응답에 URL 인용 정보가 없어, AI가 기록한 근거 자료 목록을 출처로 표시합니다.\"], \"aibomDraft\": {\"model\": {\"artifact\": {\"format\": null, \"tensor_type\": \"BF16 · U8\"}, \"modality\": {\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"], \"languages\": []}, \"tokenizer\": {\"name\": \"o200k_harmony BPE\", \"vocab_size\": 201088}, \"limitations\": [\"Must be used with the harmony response format to work correctly\", \"Chain-of-thought is not intended to be shown directly to end users\", \"Can hallucinate; it underperformed OpenAI o4-mini on SimpleQA and PersonQA\", \"Instruction-hierarchy robustness is weaker than OpenAI o4-mini in reported evaluations\", \"Not intended for diagnosis or treatment of disease\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 24, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 20914757184, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE (YaRN)\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"Configurable low, medium, and high reasoning effort\", \"Chain-of-thought reasoning\", \"Function calling and structured outputs\", \"Web browsing and Python code-execution tool use\", \"Fine-tuning for specialized use cases\"], \"intended_use\": \"An open-weight reasoning and agentic text-generation model intended for lower-latency local or specialized developer use cases. It is designed for harmony-formatted chat, configurable reasoning effort, function calling, browsing, Python tool use, and structured outputs.\", \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/config.json\", \"https://huggingface.co/api/models/openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\"], \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2024-06\"}, \"datasets\": [{\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss pretraining mixture\", \"size\": \"Trillions of tokens\", \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN pre-training filters reused from GPT-4o.\"], \"description\": \"A text-only corpus of trillions of tokens focused on STEM, coding, and general knowledge.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss post-training mixture\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-post-training-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Used for supervised fine-tuning and chain-of-thought reinforcement learning for reasoning and tool use.\"], \"description\": \"A broad, undisclosed post-training mixture of coding, mathematics, science, and other problems.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cais/mmlu\", \"name\": \"MMLU\", \"size\": \"100K - 1M examples\", \"license\": \"mit\", \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"cais/mmlu\", \"provider\": \"Center for AI Safety\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"A multilingual-free English multiple-choice benchmark covering a broad range of academic subjects.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cais/mmlu/tree/main/all\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Idavidrein/gpqa\", \"name\": \"GPQA Diamond\", \"size\": \"1K - 10K examples\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"Idavidrein/gpqa\", \"provider\": \"David Rein\", \"processing\": [\"The gpt-oss model card reports both no-tools and with-tools GPQA Diamond evaluation configurations.\"], \"description\": \"The Diamond subset of the graduate-level Google-proof question-answering benchmark.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Idavidrein/gpqa/tree/main\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://www.swebench.com/SWE-bench/guides/quickstart/\", \"name\": \"SWE-bench Verified\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:swe-bench-verified\", \"provider\": \"SWE-bench\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"A human-verified software-engineering benchmark of issue-resolution tasks drawn from real repositories.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://github.com/SWE-bench/SWE-bench/blob/main/docs/guides/datasets.md\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://openai.com/index/healthbench/\", \"name\": \"HealthBench\", \"size\": \"5,000 conversations\", \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:healthbench\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Conversations were created through synthetic generation and human adversarial testing.\", \"Responses are graded against physician-written rubric criteria.\"], \"description\": \"A rubric-based evaluation of model responses in realistic health conversations involving individuals and healthcare professionals.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://openai.com/index/healthbench/\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://openai.com/index/healthbench/\", \"name\": \"HealthBench Hard\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [{\"dataset\": \"slug:healthbench\", \"relation\": \"subset_of\"}], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:healthbench-hard\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"A challenging subset of HealthBench health conversations.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://openai.com/index/healthbench/\", \"name\": \"HealthBench Consensus\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [{\"dataset\": \"slug:healthbench\", \"relation\": \"subset_of\"}], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:healthbench-consensus\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"A HealthBench subset validated by the consensus of multiple physicians.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"MMMLU\", \"size\": \"14 languages\", \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:mmmlu\", \"provider\": null, \"processing\": [\"Answers were parsed by removing extraneous Markdown or LaTeX and searching for translations of \'Answer\' in the prompted language.\"], \"description\": \"A professionally human-translated version of MMLU evaluated across 14 languages.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}], \"unknowns\": [\"The separately named immediate pretrained checkpoint used before post-training is not disclosed.\", \"The identities, licenses, and proportions of individual pretraining-corpus sources are not disclosed.\", \"The identities, licenses, sizes, and proportions of individual supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement-learning data sources are not disclosed.\", \"Officially supported languages are not enumerated for this repository.\", \"Training hyperparameters for this specific 20B checkpoint are not fully disclosed.\"], \"provenance\": {\"notes\": \"OpenAI states that the released model was pretrained and then post-trained with supervised fine-tuning and chain-of-thought reinforcement learning. It does not disclose a separately named or released immediate pretrained checkpoint.\", \"origin\": \"gpt-oss\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"relation\": \"instruction_tuned_from\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, \"references\": [{\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\", \"type\": \"model_card\", \"title\": \"openai/gpt-oss-20b model card\", \"revision\": \"6cee5e81ee83917806bbde320786a8fb61efebee\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/config.json\", \"type\": \"config\", \"title\": \"openai/gpt-oss-20b config.json\", \"revision\": \"6cee5e81ee83917806bbde320786a8fb61efebee\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/tokenizer_config.json\", \"type\": \"config\", \"title\": \"openai/gpt-oss-20b tokenizer_config.json\", \"revision\": \"6cee5e81ee83917806bbde320786a8fb61efebee\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/api/models/openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"type\": \"config\", \"title\": \"Hugging Face model API metadata for op