-oss\", \"origin\": \"aibom_reference\", \"excerpt\": null}, {\"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/cais/mmlu/blob/main/README.md?code=true\", \"title\": \"Dataset Card for MMLU\", \"origin\": \"aibom_reference\", \"excerpt\": null}, {\"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Idavidrein/gpqa/tree/main\", \"title\": \"Idavidrein/gpqa\", \"origin\": \"aibom_reference\", \"excerpt\": null}, {\"url\": \"https://github.com/SWE-bench/SWE-bench/blob/main/docs/guides/datasets.md\", \"title\": \"SWE-bench datasets guide\", \"origin\": \"aibom_reference\", \"excerpt\": null}, {\"url\": \"https://openai.com/index/healthbench/\", \"title\": \"Introducing HealthBench\", \"origin\": \"aibom_reference\", \"excerpt\": null}], \"research\": {\"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.6-terra\", \"usage\": {\"cost\": 0.512921, \"is_byok\": false, \"cost_details\": {\"upstream_inference_cost\": 0.512921, \"upstream_inference_prompt_cost\": 0.227981, \"upstream_inference_completions_cost\": 0.16494}, \"total_tokens\": 124542, \"prompt_tokens\": 110797, \"completion_tokens\": 13745, \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\"audio_tokens\": 0, \"video_tokens\": 0, \"cached_tokens\": 0, \"cache_write_tokens\": 12774}, \"server_tool_use_details\": {\"web_search_requests\": 12}, \"completion_tokens_details\": {\"audio_tokens\": 0, \"image_tokens\": 0, \"reasoning_tokens\": 7701}}, \"source\": \"paper\", \"provider\": \"OpenRouter\", \"webSearchRequests\": 12}, \"warnings\": [\"기존 가족 목록에 gpt-oss가 없어 `familyKey: gptoss`와 `familyName: gpt-oss`를 새로 만들었습니다.\", \"공개된 별도 사전학습 전용 체크포인트나 명시적 기술 부모가 확인되지 않았습니다. 핵심 공식 릴리스라는 점을 기준으로 catalog role은 BASE로 분류했지만, 모델 자체는 사전학습 뒤 distillation·RL post-training을 거쳤으므로 검토자가 이 UI 분류를 확인해야 합니다.\", \"논문은 총 파라미터를 20.91B로만 보고하며 정확한 정수 파라미터 수를 제공하지 않으므로 `aibom.model.architecture.parameter_count`는 null로 두었습니다.\", \"`modelVersion` 6cee5e8은 논문 버전이 아니라 조사 시점 Hugging Face `main`의 최상단 커밋입니다.\", \"논문은 large-scale distillation을 언급하지만 교사 모델의 이름, 개별 학습 데이터, RL 보상/하이퍼파라미터를 공개하지 않습니다. 해당 항목은 추정하지 않았습니다.\", \"OpenRouter 응답에 URL 인용 정보가 없어, AI가 기록한 근거 자료 목록을 출처로 표시합니다.\"], \"aibomDraft\": {\"model\": {\"artifact\": {\"format\": \"MXFP4\", \"tensor_type\": \"MXFP4 (MoE weights)\"}, \"modality\": {\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"], \"languages\": []}, \"tokenizer\": {\"name\": \"o200k_harmony BPE\", \"vocab_size\": 201088}, \"limitations\": [\"The model should use the harmony response format; other formats may not work correctly.\", \"It is not intended to diagnose or treat disease and does not replace a medical professional.\", \"It can hallucinate, including in its unrestricted chains of thought.\", \"It generally underperforms OpenAI o4-mini on instruction-hierarchy evaluations.\", \"Open weights can be fine-tuned to bypass default safety refusals.\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 24, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": null, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE with YaRN\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"Configurable low, medium, and high reasoning effort\", \"Web browsing tool use\", \"Python code-execution tool use\", \"Developer-provided function calling\", \"Structured Outputs\", \"Fine-tuning and customization\"], \"intended_use\": \"A text-only open-weight reasoning model designed for agentic workflows requiring instruction following, web browsing, Python tool use, developer-provided functions, and configurable reasoning effort. It is intended to be deployed using the harmony chat format.\", \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/config.json\", \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\"], \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2024-06\"}, \"datasets\": [{\"u