st-trained with supervised fine-tuning and chain-of-thought reinforcement learning. It does not disclose a separately named or released immediate pretrained checkpoint.\", \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}}, \"safety_ethics\": {\"extensions\": {\"risk_summary\": \"The default model is trained to follow OpenAI safety policies, but its open weights can be fine-tuned or otherwise modified to enhance harmful capabilities and require downstream system-level safeguards.\"}, \"mitigation\": [{\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Pretraining data was filtered for harmful content, particularly hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN filters reused from GPT-4o.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment and instruction-hierarchy training to teach refusal of unsafe prompts and resistance to prompt injection.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Developers can fine-tune the models to improve robustness to jailbreaks encountered in their deployments.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Developers should not directly show raw chains of thought to end users without filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}], \"safety_risk\": [{\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Open-weight access enables downstream actors, including malicious parties, to modify the model and potentially expand harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model underperformed OpenAI o4-mini on reported instruction-hierarchy evaluations, including prompt-injection-hijacking resistance.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model can hallucinate; reported SimpleQA and PersonQA results show lower accuracy and higher hallucination rates than OpenAI o4-mini.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Unrestricted chains of thought can contain hallucinated content or language inconsistent with OpenAI safety policies.\"}], \"prohibited_use\": [{\"reference\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Use in violation of applicable law is not permitted under the repository usage policy.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Use must comply with all applicable law.\"}], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Unrestricted chains of thought can contain hallucinated content and language that does not reflect OpenAI\'s standard safety policies.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model is not intended to replace medical professionals or to diagnose or treat disease.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\", \"description\": \"Developers and enterprises may need to implement additional safeguards to reproduce system-level protections available in OpenAI-hosted systems.\"}]}, \"license_policy\": [{\"license\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"extensions\": {\"kind\": \"declared\", \"source\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"The model repository declares Apache-2.0 and includes a separate usage-policy file.\", \"license_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/LICENSE\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/USAGE_POLICY\"}, \"restrictions\": [\"Users agree to comply with all applicable law.\"], \"usage_policy\": \"USAGE_POLICY\"}], \"transformation\": {\"input\": [], \"method\": [\"pretraining\", \"large-scale distillation\", \"chain-of-thought reinforcement-learning post-training\", \"deliberative alignment\", \"instruction-hierarchy training\", \"MXFP4 post-training quantization\"], \"datasets\": [{\"role\": \"pretraining\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-mixture\"}, {\"role\": \"other\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-posttraining-mixture\"}], \"objective\": \"Produce an open-weight reasoning model with strong agentic tool-use capabilities, configurable reasoning effort, and default safety behavior.\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"extensions\": {\"notes\": \"The paper does not disclose individual pretraining sources, exact token count, teacher identities, or post-training hyperparameters. It states that post-training used similar CoT RL techniques to OpenAI o3.\", \"evidence\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"]}, \"hyperparameters\": null}}, \"draft\": {\"modelId\": \"openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"modelUrl\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"supplier\": \"OpenAI\", \"bomFormat\": null, \"familyKey\": \"gptoss\", \"modelName\": \"gpt-oss-20b\", \"modelRole\": \"INSTRUCT\", \"namespace\": \"openai\", \"bomVersion\": null, \"familyName\": \"gpt-oss\", \"packageUrl\": \"pkg:huggingface/openai/gpt-oss-20b@6cee5e81\", \"tensorType\": \"BF16 · U8\", \"description\": \"OpenAI\'s official 21B-parameter open-weight gpt-oss instruction/chat model for lower-latency local or specialized reasoning and agentic use cases. The accompanying model card, “gpt-oss-120b & gpt-oss-20b Model Card” (arXiv:2508.1092