: 0, \"video_tokens\": 0, \"cached_tokens\": 0, \"cache_write_tokens\": 22866}, \"completion_tokens_details\": {\"audio_tokens\": 0, \"image_tokens\": 0, \"reasoning_tokens\": 662}}, \"source\": \"merged\", \"provider\": \"OpenRouter\"}, \"warnings\": [\"요청한 식별자 `openai/gpt-oss-20b`는 Hugging Face의 공개 OpenAI 저장소와 정확히 일치합니다.\", \"카탈로그에 기존 gpt-oss familyKey가 없으므로 `gptoss`와 `gpt-oss`를 새로 제안했습니다.\", \"공개된 별도 BASE 체크포인트 또는 정확한 즉시 부모 저장소는 확인되지 않았습니다. 문서는 이 모델이 pretraining 뒤 SFT 및 CoT RL로 post-training되었다고만 설명하므로 parentCandidates는 비워 두었습니다.\", \"모델 역할이 Hugging Face 입력에서는 INSTRUCT이고 논문 입력에서는 BASE로 충돌합니다. 별도 공개 BASE가 없으나 주된 post-trained chat/instruction 배포물이라는 저장소 근거에 따라 INSTRUCT를 선택했습니다.\", \"modelVersion과 packageUrl의 SHA 길이가 입력 간에 충돌합니다. Hugging Face API의 8자리 revision `6cee5e81`을 선택했습니다.\", \"아티팩트 정밀도 표기가 Hugging Face 입력의 `BF16 · U8`와 논문 입력의 `MXFP4 (MoE weights)`로 달라 검토가 필요합니다.\", \"훈련 데이터는 고수준 설명만 공개되었습니다. 개별 코퍼스·post-training 데이터셋의 명칭, 라이선스, 비율은 추정하지 않았습니다.\"], \"aibomDraft\": {\"model\": {\"artifact\": {\"format\": \"MXFP4\", \"tensor_type\": \"BF16 · U8\"}, \"modality\": {\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"], \"languages\": []}, \"tokenizer\": {\"name\": \"o200k_harmony BPE\", \"vocab_size\": 201088}, \"limitations\": [\"Must be used with the harmony response format to work correctly\", \"Chain-of-thought is not intended to be shown directly to end users\", \"Can hallucinate; it underperformed OpenAI o4-mini on SimpleQA and PersonQA\", \"Instruction-hierarchy robustness is weaker than OpenAI o4-mini in reported evaluations\", \"Not intended for diagnosis or treatment of disease\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 24, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 20914757184, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE (YaRN)\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"Configurable low, medium, and high reasoning effort\", \"Chain-of-thought reasoning\", \"Function calling and structured outputs\", \"Web browsing and Python code-execution tool use\", \"Fine-tuning for specialized use cases\"], \"intended_use\": \"An open-weight reasoning and agentic text-generation model intended for lower-latency local or specialized developer use cases. It is designed for harmony-formatted chat, configurable reasoning effort, function calling, browsing, Python tool use, and structured outputs.\", \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\", \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/config.json\", \"https://huggingface.co/api/models/openai/gpt-oss-20b\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\"], \"knowledge_cutoff\": \"2024-06\"}, \"datasets\": [{\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss pretraining mixture\", \"size\": \"Trillions of tokens\", \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN pre-training filters reused from GPT-4o.\"], \"description\": \"A text-only corpus of trillions of tokens focused on STEM, coding, and general knowledge.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss post-training mixture\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-post-training-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Used for supervised fine-tuning and chain-of-thought reinforcement learning for reasoning and tool use.\"], \"description\": \"A broad, undisclosed post-training mixture of coding, mathematics, science, and other problems.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"gpt-oss post-training mixture\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:gpt-oss-posttraining-mixture\", \"provider\": \"OpenAI\", \"processing\": [\"Used for post-training with chain-of-thought reinforcement-learning techniques.\", \"Used with the harmony chat format and training for variable reasoning effort and agentic tools.\"], \"description\": \"An undisclosed post-training mixture spanning coding, mathematics, science, and other problem domains.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"partially_disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"AIME 2024\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:aime-2024\", \"provider\": null, \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"Competition mathematics benchmark used to assess mathematical reasoning.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": null, \"name\": \"AIME 2025\", \"size\": null, \"license\": null, \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"slug:aime-2025\", \"provider\": null, \"processing\": [], \"description\": \"Competition mathematics benchmark used to assess mathematical reasoning.\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\"], \"disclosure_status\": \"disclosed\"}, {\"uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Idavidrein/gpqa\", \"name\": \"GPQA Diamond\", \"size\": \"1K - 10K examples\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"parents\": [], \"version\": null, \"identity\": \"Idavidrein/gpqa\", \"provider\": \"David Rein\", \"processing\": [\"The gpt-oss model card reports both no-tools and wi