/cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Pretraining data was filtered for harmful content, particularly hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN filters reused from GPT-4o.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment and instruction-hierarchy training to teach refusal of unsafe prompts and resistance to prompt injection.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Developers can fine-tune the models to improve robustness to jailbreaks encountered in their deployments.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Developers should not directly show raw chains of thought to end users without filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}], \"safety_risk\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Open-weight access enables downstream actors, including malicious parties, to modify the model and potentially expand harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model underperformed OpenAI o4-mini on reported instruction-hierarchy evaluations, including prompt-injection-hijacking resistance.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model can hallucinate; reported SimpleQA and PersonQA results show lower accuracy and higher hallucination rates than OpenAI o4-mini.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Unrestricted chains of thought can contain hallucinated content or language inconsistent with OpenAI safety policies.\"}], \"risk_summary\": \"The default model is trained to follow OpenAI safety policies, but its open weights can be fine-tuned or otherwise modified to enhance harmful capabilities and require downstream system-level safeguards.\", \"prohibited_use\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Use in violation of applicable law is not permitted under the repository usage policy.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"Use must comply with all applicable law.\"}], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"Unrestricted chains of thought can contain hallucinated content and language that does not reflect OpenAI\'s standard safety policies.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/419b6906-9da6-406c-a19d-1bb078ac7637/oai_gpt-oss_model_card.pdf\", \"description\": \"The model is not intended to replace medical professionals or to diagnose or treat disease.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://openai.com/index/gpt-oss-model-card/\", \"description\": \"Developers and enterprises may need to implement additional safeguards to reproduce system-level protections available in OpenAI-hosted systems.\"}]}, \"license_policy\": [{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"license\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"The model repository declares Apache-2.0 and includes a separate usage-policy file.\", \"source_url\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/README.md\", \"license_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/LICENSE\", \"restrictions\": [\"Users agree to comply with all applicable law.\"], \"usage_policy\": \"USAGE_POLICY\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://huggingface.co/openai/gpt-oss-20b/raw/main/USAGE_POLICY\"}], \"transformation\