ng CBRN filters.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment and instruction-hierarchy training to teach refusals and improve resistance to prompt injection.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Deployers may need additional safeguards to reproduce system-level protections; chain-of-thought should not be shown directly to end users without filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}], \"safety_risk\": [{\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The released weights cannot be further mitigated or access revoked by OpenAI after release; determined attackers may fine-tune the model to bypass refusals or optimize it for harm.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model\'s chain-of-thought can include hallucinated material, including content inconsistent with OpenAI safety policies.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Reported hallucination evaluations show lower accuracy and higher hallucination rates than OpenAI o4-mini on SimpleQA and PersonQA.\"}], \"prohibited_use\": [], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"reference\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model was evaluated for fairness and bias using BBQ; the report provides scores for ambiguous and disambiguated questions.\"}, {\"reference\": \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\", \"description\": \"Health benchmark results are not evidence that the model is suitable for clinical diagnosis or treatment.\"}]}, \"license_policy\": [{\"license\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"extensions\": {\"kind\": \"declared\", \"source\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/LICENSE\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"The repository declares Apache 2.0; OpenAI also identifies the GPT-OSS Usage Policy as applicable.\", \"license_uri\": \"https://www.apach