되어 있지만 교사 모델 ID는 공개되지 않았습니다. 따라서 특정 교사 모델을 입력이나 카탈로그 부모로 추정하지 않았고, provenance는 부분 공개로 표시했습니다.\", \"공식 모델 카드의 총 파라미터 수 116.83B를 정수 필드에 십진 단위로 환산해 기록했습니다. 보고서에는 이보다 더 정밀한 미반올림 정수값이 없습니다.\", \"공식 저장소에서 아티팩트 버전 커밋 SHA를 이 초안에 고정하지 않아 modelVersion은 null입니다.\", \"OpenRouter 응답에 URL 인용 정보가 없어, AI가 기록한 근거 자료 목록을 출처로 표시합니다.\"], \"aibomDraft\": {\"model\": {\"artifact\": {\"format\": null, \"tensor_type\": \"MXFP4 for MoE weights\"}, \"modality\": {\"input\": [\"text\"], \"output\": [\"text\"], \"languages\": []}, \"tokenizer\": {\"name\": \"o200k_harmony (BPE)\", \"vocab_size\": 201088}, \"limitations\": [\"The model can hallucinate; its SimpleQA and PersonQA results were below OpenAI o4-mini in the reported evaluations.\", \"The model is not a substitute for a medical professional and is not intended for disease diagnosis or treatment.\", \"Open-weight deployment allows downstream fine-tuning that may bypass refusals or increase harmful capabilities; deployers may need additional safeguards.\", \"The report found weaker instruction-hierarchy performance than OpenAI o4-mini on the reported tests.\"], \"architecture\": {\"family\": \"autoregressive Mixture-of-Experts Transformer\", \"layers\": 36, \"kv_heads\": 8, \"activation\": \"gated SwiGLU\", \"hidden_size\": 2880, \"context_length\": 131072, \"attention_heads\": 64, \"parameter_count\": 116830000000, \"position_embedding\": \"RoPE; YaRN context extension\"}, \"capabilities\": [\"chain-of-thought reasoning\", \"adjustable low, medium, and high reasoning effort\", \"web browsing and Python tool use\", \"developer-provided function calling\", \"instruction following\", \"structured outputs\"], \"intended_use\": \"A general-purpose, high-reasoning model intended for production use and agentic workflows, including browser-based research, Python tool use, and developer-provided function calling. It supports configurable reasoning effort and structured outputs.\", \"release_date\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://