deforces (with tools)\", \"score_text\": null, \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"reported_at\": \"2025-08-08\", \"baseline_model\": null, \"baseline_score\": null, \"evaluator_model\": null, \"configuration_notes\": \"High reasoning effort; held-out split; with terminal tool.\"}], \"safety_ethics\": {\"mitigation\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Pretraining data was filtered for harmful content, particularly hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN filters.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment and instruction-hierarchy training to teach refusals and improve resistance to prompt injection.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Deployers may need additional safeguards to reproduce system-level protections; chain-of-thought should not be shown directly to end users without filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Pretraining data was filtered for harmful content, especially hazardous biosecurity knowledge, using CBRN pretraining filters reused from GPT-4o.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Post-training used deliberative alignment to teach refusals, jailbreak robustness, and adherence to the instruction hierarchy.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"OpenAI conducted scalable capability evaluations and adversarial fine-tuning evaluations for biological/chemical and cyber risks; external Safety Advisory Group review is reported.\"}], \"safety_risk\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The released weights cannot be further mitigated or access revoked by OpenAI after release; determined attackers may fine-tune the model to bypass refusals or optimize it for harm.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model\'s chain-of-thought can include hallucinated material, including content inconsistent with OpenAI safety policies.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Reported hallucination evaluations show lower accuracy and higher hallucination rates than OpenAI o4-mini on SimpleQA and PersonQA.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"Open-weight models can be fine-tuned by downstream actors to bypass safety refusals or enhance harmful capabilities.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The report identifies hallucinations and warns that exposed chain-of-thought can contain hallucinated content or language inconsistent with standard safety policies.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The default model did not meet the report’s indicative High capability threshold in biological and chemical, cyber, or AI self-improvement tracked categories; adversarially fine-tuned versions were also evaluated.\"}], \"risk_summary\": \"Open-weight release carries misuse risks because downstream users can fine-tune the model to weaken refusals or increase harmful capabilities; OpenAI recommends that deployers apply safeguards appropriate to their systems.\", \"prohibited_use\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\", \"description\": \"The accompanying gpt-oss usage policy requires users to comply with all applicable law.\"}], \"ethical_considerations\": [{\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model was evaluated for fairness and bias using BBQ; the report provides scores for ambiguous and disambiguated questions.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\", \"description\": \"Health benchmark results are not evidence that the model is suitable for clinical diagnosis or treatment.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The model is text-only and does not replace a medical professional or serve as a tool for disease diagnosis or treatment.\"}, {\"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"description\": \"The report advises against showing chain-of-thought directly to end users without additional filtering, moderation, or summarization.\"}]}, \"license_policy\": [{\"kind\": \"declared\", \"license\": \"Apache License 2.0\", \"spdx_id\": \"Apache-2.0\", \"scope_note\": \"The repository declares Apache 2.0; OpenAI also identifies the GPT-OSS Usage Policy as applicable.\", \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/LICENSE\", \"license_uri\": \"https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\", \"restrictions\": [\"Use is subject to the GPT-OSS Usage Policy.\"], \"usage_policy\": \"GPT-OSS Usage Policy\", \"commercial_use\": \"allowed\", \"usage_policy_uri\": \"https://github.com/openai/gpt-oss/blob/main/USAGE_POLICY\"}], \"transformation\": {\"notes\": \"The report states that pretraining used trillions of text tokens focused on STEM, coding, and general knowledge, with CBRN-related harmful-content filtering. Post-training used a broad range of coding, math, science, and other problems; exact corpus composition, distillation sources, and most training settings are undisclosed. Quantization is reported for MoE weights at MXFP4 (4.25 bits per parameter).\", \"inputs\": [], \"method\": [\"text-only pretraining\", \"large-scale distillation (details undisclosed)\", \"chain-of-thought reinforcement-learning post-training for reasoning and tool use\", \"supervised instruction-hierarchy post-training\", \"MXFP4 post-training quantization of MoE weights\"], \"datasets\": [{\"role\": \"pretraining\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-pretraining-mixture\"}, {\"role\": \"finetuning\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-posttraining-mixture\"}, {\"role\": \"other\", \"dataset\": \"slug:gpt-oss-posttraining-problem-mixture\"}], \"objective\": \"Create an open-weight reasoning model with strong reasoning and agentic tool-use capabilities, while reducing inference memory through MoE and MXFP4 quantization.\", \"timestamp\": \"2025-08-05\", \"evidence_urls\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.10925\", \"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-oss/\"], \"hyperparameters\": []}}, \"aibomSummary\": {\"datasets\": 8, \"licenses\": 1, \"references\": 15, \"evaluations\": 23, \"method_steps\": 5, \"safety_items\": 17, \"transformation_inputs\": 0}, \"areaDecisions\": [{\"area\": \"model\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"아키텍처와 모델 카드 정보는 저장소 자료를 우선하고 논문이 비워 둔 항목만 보완했습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"provenance\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"저장소 및 공식 모델 카드의 계보 정보를 우선했으며 직접 부모는 두 입력 모두 특정하지 않습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"transformation\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"방법·목적·학습 데이터는 논문을 우선하고 입력 모델은 저장소 자료를 확인했으나 둘 다 비어 있습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"datasets\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"서로 다른 식별자의 학습 및 평가 데이터셋을 두 입력에서 합쳤습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"evaluations\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"동일한 출처의 벤치마크 결과를 중복 제거하고 각 입력의 고유 평가 행을 합쳤습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"safety_ethics\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"두 입력에 기록된 안전·윤리 항목을 합치고 완전히 같은 항목만 제거했습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"license_policy\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"저장소가 선언한 라이선스 및 사용 정책 정보를 우선했습니다.\"}, {\"area\": \"references\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"두 입력의 출처를 URI 기준으로 중복 제거해 합쳤습니다.\"}], \"fieldDecisions\": [{\"field\": \"modelId\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"두 입력의 공식 저장소 식별자가 일치하며 저장소 기준값을 사용했습니다.\"}, {\"field\": \"namespace\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"저장소 네임스페이스는 두 입력에서 일치합니다.\"}, {\"field\": \"modelName\", \"chosen\": \"huggingface\", \"rationale\": \"저장소 모델명은 두 입력에서 일치합니다.\"}, {\"field\": \"familyKey\", \"chosen\": \"combined\", \"rationale\": \"두 입력이 같은 새 가족 키를 제안했고 기존 카탈로그 가족과 일치하는 항목이 없습니다.\