{\"notes\": \"The report describes the two-stage pretraining approach and broad corpus curation. It does not disclose a 70B-specific token allocation or a complete 70B training recipe.\", \"evidence\": [\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.21783\", \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B/blob/main/README.md\", \"https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/blob/main/models/sku_list.py\"]}, \"hyperparameters\": {\"peak_learning_rate\": \"1.5e-4\", \"final_context_length\": \"128K\", \"initial_context_length\": \"8K\"}}}, \"draft\": {\"modelId\": \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"modelUrl\": \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"supplier\": \"meta-llama\", \"bomFormat\": null, \"familyKey\": \"llama31\", \"modelName\": \"Llama-3.1-70B\", \"modelRole\": \"BASE\", \"namespace\": \"meta-llama\", \"bomVersion\": null, \"familyName\": \"Llama 3.1\", \"packageUrl\": \"pkg:huggingface/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"tensorType\": \"BF16\", \"description\": \"Meta\'s official pretrained 70B-class base checkpoint in the Llama 3.1 family, intended for adaptation to natural-language-generation tasks and other documented uses subject to its license and use policy. The technical report, The Llama 3 Herd of Models (arXiv:2407.21783), identifies Llama 3.1 70B as a multilingual, long-context pretrained model and refers to its Llama 3.1 results as Llama 3 for brevity.\", \"detailsJson\": {\"model\": {\"id\": \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"title\": \"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B\", \"sources\": [\"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B/blob/main/README.md\", \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B/tree/main\", \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B/blob/main/config.json\", \"https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/blob/main/models/sku_list.py\", \"https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models\", \"https://github.com/meta-llama/llama-models/blob/main/models/llama3_1/LICENSE\", \"https://github.c